[
  {
    "comment": "模式校验：只调用 QD 本地 util，不访问外站或浏览器助手。空值按 cookie 处理；其他值必须明确失败，避免用浏览器助手 HTTP 404 充当非法模式信号。",
    "request": {
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "api://util/unicode",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Content-Type",
          "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
        }
      ],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "content={{ '模式校验通过：password' if (login_mode | default('cookie', true) | lower | trim) == 'password' else ('模式校验通过：cookie' if (login_mode | default('cookie', true) | lower | trim) in ('', 'cookie') else '模式校验失败：login_mode 仅支持 cookie 或 password') }}"
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "模式校验通过：(?:cookie|password)",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "^(?!200$).+$",
          "from": "status"
        },
        {
          "re": "模式校验失败：login_mode 仅支持 cookie 或 password",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "extract_variables": []
    }
  },
  {
    "request": {
      "url": "{% if str(login_mode).strip().lower() == 'password' %}"
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "账号密码模式：由可见浏览器助手复用 profile_name 对应的登录态。密码只发送给内网服务，不写入日志；Cap CAPTCHA、二次验证或登录失效时由服务返回 login_required/interactive_login_required。",
    "request": {
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "http://sb-forum-browser:8766/api/signin",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Accept",
          "value": "application/json"
        },
        {
          "name": "Content-Type",
          "value": "application/json"
        },
        {
          "name": "X-SB-Forum-Token",
          "value": "{{browser_api_token}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "X-QD-Direct",
          "value": "1"
        }
      ],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "{{ {'profile_name': (profile_name | default('default', true)), 'username': (username | default('', true)), 'password': (password | default('', true))} | tojson }}"
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "\\\"(?:status|result)\\\"\\s*:\\s*\\\"(?:ok|success|signed|signed_in|already_signed|already_signed_in|checkin_success|completed|done)\\\"",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "^(?:400|401|403|409|429|500|502|503)$",
          "from": "status"
        },
        {
          "re": "login_required|interactive_login_required|captcha|二次验证|profile[^\\n]{0,40}(?:occupied|locked)|timeout|超时|invalid|error|失败",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "extract_variables": [
        {
          "name": "account_name",
          "re": "\\\"(?:username|account_name)\\\"\\s*:\\s*\\\"([^\\\"]+)\\\"",
          "from": "content"
        },
        {
          "name": "sign_message",
          "re": "\\\"(?:message|result_message)\\\"\\s*:\\s*\\\"([^\\\"]+)\\\"",
          "from": "content"
        },
        {
          "name": "sign_reward",
          "re": "\\\"(?:reward|sign_reward|points|bonus)\\\"\\s*:\\s*(\\d+)",
          "from": "content"
        },
        {
          "name": "streak_days",
          "re": "\\\"(?:streak_days|continuous_days)\\\"\\s*:\\s*(\\d+)",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "request": {
      "url": "{% else %}"
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "Cookie 模式（默认）：请求签到页并从当前 HTML 提取最新 CSRF。成功识别必须同时存在 CSRF 输入，以及原生立即签到按钮或已签到状态标记；已签到时按钮可以消失。login_mode 的空值、大小写和首尾空格均归一化；模式校验已在首请求完成，保留本地 util 兜底而不触发浏览器助手 404。",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "{{ 'https://sb.sb/signin/' if (login_mode | default('cookie', true) | lower | trim) in ('', 'cookie') else 'api://util/unicode' }}",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "X-QD-Impersonate",
          "value": "{{browser_fingerprint | default('chrome', true)}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Cookie",
          "value": "{{cookie}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "User-Agent",
          "value": "{{browser_user_agent | default('auto', true)}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept",
          "value": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,image/avif,image/webp,*/*;q=0.8"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept-Language",
          "value": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9,en;q=0.8"
        },
        {
          "name": "Referer",
          "value": "https://sb.sb/signin/"
        }
      ],
      "cookies": []
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "^200$",
          "from": "status"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "^(?!200$).+$",
          "from": "status"
        },
        {
          "re": "^(?:301|302|303|307|308|401|403|429)$",
          "from": "status"
        },
        {
          "re": "(?s)^(?!(?:(?=.*\\bbtn-post\\b)(?=.*立即签到)|(?=.*(?:data-checked-in|今日(?:已|已经)签到|已签到)))).*$",
          "from": "content"
        },
        {
          "re": "(?s)(?:<form\\b[^>]*\\baction\\s*=\\s*[\"'][^\"']*/login/?[^\"']*[\"'][^>]*>|<form\\b[^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?<input\\b[^>]*(?:name|id)\\s*=\\s*[\"'](?:username|user|email)[\"'][^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?<input\\b[^>]*(?:name|id|type)\\s*=\\s*[\"'](?:password|passwd|pwd)[\"'][^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?</form>|<form\\b[^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?<input\\b[^>]*(?:name|id|type)\\s*=\\s*[\"'](?:password|passwd|pwd)[\"'][^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?<input\\b[^>]*(?:name|id)\\s*=\\s*[\"'](?:username|user|email)[\"'][^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?</form>|cap-widget|Just a moment|cf-chl-|cdn-cgi/challenge-platform|请先登录|未登录)",
          "from": "content"
        },
        {
          "re": "(?is)^(?!.*_csrf).*$",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "extract_variables": [
        {
          "name": "csrf_token",
          "re": "<input[^>]*name=[\"']_csrf[\"'][^>]*value=[\"']([^\"']+)[\"']",
          "from": "content"
        },
        {
          "name": "checked_in_today",
          "re": "data-checked-in=[\"'](true|false)[\"']",
          "from": "content"
        },
        {
          "name": "already_signed_marker",
          "re": "今日(?:已|已经)签到|已签到",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "request": {
      "url": "{% if already_signed_marker %}"
    }
  },
  {
    "request": {
      "url": "{% else %}"
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "提交站点原生签到表单。站点对重复签到应返回今日已签到等幂等结果；最终 GET 仍必须确认页面处于已签到状态。",
    "request": {
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "https://sb.sb/signin/",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "X-QD-Impersonate",
          "value": "{{browser_fingerprint | default('chrome', true)}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Cookie",
          "value": "{{cookie}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "User-Agent",
          "value": "{{browser_user_agent | default('auto', true)}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept",
          "value": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,image/avif,image/webp,*/*;q=0.8"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept-Language",
          "value": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9,en;q=0.8"
        },
        {
          "name": "Content-Type",
          "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
        },
        {
          "name": "Origin",
          "value": "https://sb.sb"
        },
        {
          "name": "Referer",
          "value": "https://sb.sb/signin/"
        }
      ],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "_csrf={{csrf_token}}"
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "^200$",
          "from": "status"
        },
        {
          "re": "^(?:/signin/?|https://sb\\.sb/signin/?(?:\\?.*)?)$",
          "from": "header-location"
        },
        {
          "re": "今日(?:已|已经)签到|已签到|签到成功|already\\s+signed|signed\\s+in",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "^(?:301|302|307|308|401|403|429)$",
          "from": "status"
        },
        {
          "re": "^(?!(?:/signin/?|https://sb\\.sb/signin/?(?:\\?.*)?)$).+",
          "from": "header-location"
        },
        {
            "re": "(?s)(?:<form\\b[^>]*\\baction\\s*=\\s*[\"'][^\"']*/login/?[^\"']*[\"'][^>]*>|<form\\b[^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?<input\\b[^>]*(?:name|id)\\s*=\\s*[\"'](?:username|user|email)[\"'][^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?<input\\b[^>]*(?:name|id|type)\\s*=\\s*[\"'](?:password|passwd|pwd)[\"'][^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?</form>|<form\\b[^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?<input\\b[^>]*(?:name|id|type)\\s*=\\s*[\"'](?:password|passwd|pwd)[\"'][^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?<input\\b[^>]*(?:name|id)\\s*=\\s*[\"'](?:username|user|email)[\"'][^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?</form>|cap-widget|Just a moment|cf-chl-|cdn-cgi/challenge-platform|请先登录|未登录|CSRF|验证失败|签到失败|错误)",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "extract_variables": [
        {
          "name": "sign_message",
          "re": "(?:今日(?:已|已经)签到|签到成功|已签到|签到失败)",
          "from": "content"
        },
        {
          "name": "sign_reward",
          "re": "(?:奖励|积分|成长值)[^\\d]{0,20}(\\d+)",
          "from": "content"
        },
        {
          "name": "streak_days",
          "re": "连续签到[^\\d]{0,20}(\\d+)",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "request": {
      "url": "{% endif %}"
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "签到后只读复查：必须看到明确的今日已签到/签到成功标记，避免将登录页、Cloudflare 页面或普通 200 页面误判为成功。",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://sb.sb/signin/",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "X-QD-Impersonate",
          "value": "{{browser_fingerprint | default('chrome', true)}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Cookie",
          "value": "{{cookie}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "User-Agent",
          "value": "{{browser_user_agent | default('auto', true)}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept",
          "value": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,image/avif,image/webp,*/*;q=0.8"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept-Language",
          "value": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9,en;q=0.8"
        },
        {
          "name": "Referer",
          "value": "https://sb.sb/signin/"
        }
      ],
      "cookies": []
    },
    "rule": {
        "success_asserts": [
          {
            "re": "今日(?:已|已经)签到|签到成功|已签到|already\\s+signed|signed\\s+in",
            "from": "content"
          }
        ],
        "failed_asserts": [
          {
            "re": "^(?:301|302|303|307|308|401|403|429)$",
            "from": "status"
          },
          {
            "re": "(?s)(?:<form\\b[^>]*\\baction\\s*=\\s*[\"'][^\"']*/login/?[^\"']*[\"'][^>]*>|<form\\b[^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?<input\\b[^>]*(?:name|id)\\s*=\\s*[\"'](?:username|user|email)[\"'][^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?<input\\b[^>]*(?:name|id|type)\\s*=\\s*[\"'](?:password|passwd|pwd)[\"'][^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?</form>|<form\\b[^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?<input\\b[^>]*(?:name|id|type)\\s*=\\s*[\"'](?:password|passwd|pwd)[\"'][^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?<input\\b[^>]*(?:name|id)\\s*=\\s*[\"'](?:username|user|email)[\"'][^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?</form>|cap-widget|Just a moment|cf-chl-|cdn-cgi/challenge-platform|请先登录|未登录|签到失败|错误)",
            "from": "content"
          }
        ],
        "extract_variables": [
          {
            "name": "sign_message",
            "re": "(?:今日(?:已|已经)签到|签到成功|已签到)",
            "from": "content"
          },
          {
            "name": "sign_reward",
            "re": "(?:奖励|积分|成长值)[^\\d]{0,20}(\\d+)",
            "from": "content"
          },
          {
            "name": "streak_days",
            "re": "连续签到[^\\d]{0,20}(\\d+)",
            "from": "content"
          }
        ]
      }
  },
  {
    "request": {
      "url": "{% endif %}"
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "生成脱敏签到日志；只输出模式、站点返回的脱敏账号和签到结果，不回显 Cookie、密码、CSRF 或浏览器会话令牌。站点按 UTC 计算日期，北京时间每日 08:00 后进入新签到日。",
    "request": {
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "api://util/unicode",
      "headers": [],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "content=烧饼论坛签到结果：模式={{ 'password' if (login_mode | default('cookie', true) | lower | trim) == 'password' else 'cookie' }}，账号：{{ (account_name | default('已登录用户', true)) if (login_mode | default('cookie', true) | lower | trim) == 'password' else '已登录用户' }}，结果：{{sign_message | default('已完成或今日已签到', true)}}，奖励：{{sign_reward | default('未返回', true)}}，连续签到：{{streak_days | default('未返回', true)}} 天，模板版本：v20260915.1"
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "^200$",
          "from": "status"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [],
      "extract_variables": [
        {
          "name": "__log__",
          "re": "\"转换后\"\\s*:\\s*\"(.*)\"",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
]
